  "html": "<div class=\"mm mm-masthead\">\n  <div class=\"mm-masthead__inner\">\n    <span class=\"mm-masthead__kicker\">Undergraduate teaching</span>\n    <h1>Twenty years of <em>first-year</em> logic and last-year networks.</h1>\n    <p class=\"mm-masthead__lede\">Eight subjects across twenty-eight semesters at the Faculty of Computing &mdash; from Digital Logic in a student&rsquo;s first weeks to Network Communications and Computer Architecture later on.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mm-metrics\">\n    <div class=\"mm-metric\"><span class=\"mm-metric__n\">8</span><span class=\"mm-metric__label\">Undergraduate subjects</span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-metric\"><span class=\"mm-metric__n\">28</span><span class=\"mm-metric__label\">Undergraduate semester entries</span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-metric\"><span class=\"mm-metric__n\">702<small>+</small></span><span class=\"mm-metric__label\">Undergraduate students since 2006</span></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mm-metrics\">\n    <div class=\"mm-metric\"><span class=\"mm-metric__n\">4</span><span class=\"mm-metric__label\">Postgraduate subjects</span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-metric\"><span class=\"mm-metric__n\">20</span><span class=\"mm-metric__label\">Postgraduate semester entries</span></div>\n    <div class=\"mm-metric\"><span class=\"mm-metric__n\">25</span><span class=\"mm-metric__label\">Postgraduate class sections</span></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mm ni-page-module\" style=\"padding:clamp(70px,8vw,112px) clamp(20px,5vw,60px);background:#171416;color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #453931\">\n<div class=\"mm-inner\">\n<div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,320px),1fr));gap:28px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:42px\">\n<div><span class=\"mm-eyebrow\" style=\"color:#c6a15b\">Teaching · scroll pathway</span><h2 style=\"margin:14px 0 0;color:#fff;font-size:clamp(34px,5vw,62px);line-height:.98\">From logic gates<br><em style=\"color:#d7c9bd;font-weight:400\">to networked systems.</em></h2></div>\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#c3b6a8;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7\">Scroll through a curriculum pathway connecting computing fundamentals with systems, communication and application development.</p>\n</div><div role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Teaching pathway\" style=\"display:grid;gap:16px;max-width:920px;margin:0 auto\">\n<div role=\"listitem\" style=\"min-height:190px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#f7f3ef;color:#171416;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b;position:sticky;top:88px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.7\">01 / FOUNDATIONS</span><div><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:25px;line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.03em\">Digital Logic</strong><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.78\">Where computing begins: representation, circuits and systematic reasoning.</p></div></div>\n<div role=\"listitem\" style=\"min-height:190px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#d8c9bd;color:#171416;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b;position:sticky;top:104px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.7\">02 / SYSTEMS</span><div><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:25px;line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.03em\">Computer Organisation &amp; Architecture</strong><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.78\">How processors, memory and machine-level structures work together.</p></div></div>\n<div role=\"listitem\" style=\"min-height:190px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#7a1f32;color:#fff;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b;position:sticky;top:120px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.7\">03 / COMMUNICATION</span><div><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:25px;line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.03em\">Network Communications</strong><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.78\">Moving information reliably across connected systems.</p></div></div>\n<div role=\"listitem\" style=\"min-height:190px;padding:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;background:#eee8e3;color:#171416;border-top:4px solid #c6a15b;position:sticky;top:136px\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;opacity:.7\">04 / APPLICATION</span><div><strong style=\"display:block;font-size:25px;line-height:1.03;letter-spacing:-.03em\">Application Development</strong><p style=\"margin:12px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;opacity:.78\">Turning systems knowledge into software people can use.</p></div></div>\n</div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"mm mm-sec\">\n  <div class=\"mm-inner\">\n    <div class=\"mm-eyebrow-row\"><span class=\"mm-eyebrow\">01 &mdash; Core subjects</span></div>\n    <h2 class=\"mm-year\">Digital Logic</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--mm-muted);margin:14px 0 20px\">Logik Digital &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; SCSR1013 / SECR1013 / SCK1023</p>\n    <table class=\"mm-table\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Academic session</th><th>Semester</th><th>Section</th><th>Students</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>2026/2027</td><td>1</td><td>04</td><td>Ongoing</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>2022/2023</td><td>2</td><td>01</td><td>46</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>2015/2016</td><td>1</td><td>01</td><td>14</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>2006/2007</td><td>2</td><td>01</td><td>2</td></tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <h2 class=\"mm-year\">Network Communications</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--mm-muted);margin:14px 0 20px\">Komunikasi Rangkaian &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; SECR1213 / SCSR1213</p>\n    <table class=\"mm-table\">\n      <thead><tr><th>Academic session</th><th>Semester</th><th>Section</th><th>Students</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr><td>2023/2024</td><td>1</td><td>09</td><td>42</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>2022/2023</td><td>1<